[Music]  as a business with a presence in the  cloud you might need to allow a third  party to use login credentials from a  different identity provider than what  you currently use let's follow the  example of omni retail to see how that  might look and how you would handle it  Omni retail provides services to their  customers with the rich set of solutions  that Google offers  they bring together data from multiple  sources across their sales Finance  inventory supplier and CRM systems into  bigquery for seamless analysis  sales staff then use a custom sales web  application to directly access those  reports and insights derived from  bigquery to provide better customer  experiences  bailstaff already use Workforce identity  Federation with their identity provider  to authenticate to bigquery Via a jdbc  connector  Omni retail faces the issue that it is  not able to share these same insights  with the international sales staff at  their affiliate run stores  those stores were outsourced to a  separate company called omnisales  worldwide who used their own totally  separate identity provider for  Authentication  due to regulatory policies in certain  locations the omnisales worldwide user  accounts could not use the identity  provider already in use  how did Omni retail share their sales  data with their affiliate run stores  Omni retail created a new Workforce pool  for omnisales worldwide to authenticate  and authorize omnisales worldwide sales  staff  now all of the sales teams can access  the bigquery data through the same  Custom Sales web application but  leverage their own identity provider for  authentication while still using single  sign-on  Workforce identity Federation supports  sinkless attribute-based single sign-on  so all user management of the  international staff can continue to be  maintained by omnisales worldwide  Omni retail was able to authorize access  to the correct users by using attributes  associated with user logins and by  creating a separate Workforce pool for  the new identity Provider by delivering  more insights to more users Omni retail  empowers the sales teams to increase the  sales per customer because all access is  authenticated and an access management  process enforced Omni retail has  confidence their data is still protected  if you'd like to learn more about how  Workforce identity Federation can help  you maintain security and gain  flexibility as to who can log in click  the link in the description or search  for Workforce identity Federation at  cloud.google.com  [Music]

